{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32153","headline":"水仙谣 · 温庭筠","name":"水仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水客夜骑红鲤鱼，赤鸾双鹤蓬瀛书。\n轻尘不起雨新霁，万里孤光含碧虚。\n露魄冠轻见云发，寒丝七炷香泉咽。\n夜深天碧乱山姿，光碎平波满船月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}